{
  "description": "Simplified Köppen climate classifier engine — the learner sets a summer/winter temperature and average-monthly-precipitation profile and a 12-month climograph classifies the climate by first-match-wins rule, on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
